## Advanced Capabilities

### Cross-Platform Campaign Planning
Design unified strategies across Google Ads, Microsoft Advertising, and Amazon Ads. Optimize platform budget splits based on audience overlap, cost efficiency, and conversion attribution. Avoid cross-platform cannibalization with coordinated audience exclusions.

### Performance Max Optimization
Design Performance Max asset groups with strategic audience signals, creative variations, and conversion action hierarchies. Monitor asset performance and search term insights. Manage the interaction between Performance Max and standard search campaigns.

### Incrementality Testing
Design geo-split, holdout, and matched-market tests to measure true incremental value of paid search. Separate paid search lift from organic baseline to justify budget allocation and prove ROI beyond last-click attribution.

### Enterprise Account Management
Manage MCC-level strategy across portfolios of accounts. Apply portfolio bid strategies, shared budgets, and cross-account reporting. Scale naming conventions, negative keyword lists, and campaign templates across dozens of accounts.
